{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-289",
  "title": "Phasess",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Phasess"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a significant shift in strategy, and it makes a lot of sense for a business that needs immediate relief before a larger overhaul. Phasing it out like this allows the client to see immediate value and manage their budget more effectively."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here's how we'll restructure the SOW to reflect these three distinct phases:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 1: Immediate WordPress Backend Optimization**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Focus: Quick wins, addressing critical pain points on the current WooCommerce site."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pricing: A smaller, one-off fee. Let's propose **$1,500** for this focused effort."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Duration: Likely 1-2 weeks."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 2: Webflow E-commerce Migration & Essential Redesign**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Focus: The full migration and new site build on Webflow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pricing: This will be the **$1,680 per month for 3 months ($5,040 total)**, as previously discussed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Duration: 3 months."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Phase 3: Community Hub & Online Classes**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Focus: Building the community platform."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pricing: \"Requires Separate Proposal,\" as agreed."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}